## Practice Set Version

### Definitions

- A numbered designation for a particular, explicitly scoped revision of a collection of rules and practices, distinguished by its recorded contents and source revision\.

### Examples

- Practice Set Version \(DevEnv version 2\) is the registry snapshot pinned to commit 47fced67cde5b94c813559090dedb4d76c793938; its actual activation period remains unknown\.
- An Angular package version identifies a software release, not the development practices used to produce it\.

### Domain usage

- DevEnv
- Meta

## Practice Customization Version

### Definitions

- A numbered designation for a tracked revision of one repository\-controlled agent or skill, identified by its kind and path and pinned to the commit containing that content\.

### Examples

- Practice Customization Version \(Diligent Coder v1\) identifies the agent content at commit 47fced67cde5b94c813559090dedb4d76c793938; it does not establish when the agent entered use\.
- Practice Set Version \(DevEnv v2\) identifies a combined repository\-practice snapshot and is not the same as Diligent Coder v1\.

### Domain usage

- DevEnv
- Meta

